{"id":5111,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":514,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"海拉","content":"${PlayerName}！！${PlayerName}你还好吗？喂，听我说话呀！你这样我也很难受啊！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"颅内嚣叫声将你的神经扭作一团，精神上的痛苦转化为剧烈的抽搐感，让你狂吐不止。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"枷锁带来的压力太大了，该怎么办。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"036","content":"让开，你们也有枷锁相连，会受影响。把他交给我。","female_content":"让开，你们也有枷锁相连，会受影响的。把她交给我。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111004","vo_cgplot_5111004f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"他抓出两个异方三角，两手按在你两边太阳穴处，他的额头抵着你的，眼睛直直地看进你的眼睛。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"036","content":"醒醒，${PlayerName}，听我说话，这里只有我在跟你讲话，集中精神，思维阻断。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"036","content":"你很强大，不会败给它。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"你大口喘气，竭尽全力抓住他的声音，幽蓝色的辉光渐渐驱散眼前的异色迷雾，慢慢地，终于平复下来，禁闭者关切地看着你。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"036","content":"刚刚的那些“怪物”正是卓娅暴走的精神污染，愤怒，憎恶，仇恨，不顾一切的破坏欲。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"036","content":"她已经十分危险了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"options":["她还在战斗，跟我们一样，还没认输！"],"jump":[12],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"036","content":"……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"她有我的枷锁。也许能有别的方法阻止黑环。","style":2,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"036","content":"我明白了。你能看到我看不到的东西，如果这就是你眼中的希望……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"036","content":"那尽情战斗吧，我会保护你。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"你会战斗下去的。枷锁的那头能听到她的怒吼，卓娅还在，你抓住那条让你痛苦不已的枷锁，现在要为带她回来战斗。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"options":["卓娅，我来了，听我的声音"],"jump":[18],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"另一头传来撼动灵魂的咆哮声，你握紧036给你的三角屏蔽器，努力撑起身子，追上036，向那扇封闭的门走去。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？","content":"……别碰我！！别……命令我！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111019"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"options":["卓娅，坚持住，我来了！"],"jump":[21],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？","content":"滚远点——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111021"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"大厅的入口是沉重的双推门，被污染堵塞着，036撑住两边正在用力。你上前撑住另一边，跟他一起用力。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"options":["卓娅，是我！！"],"jump":[24],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"混沌的咆哮声戛然而止，周围三人的声音也消失了，世界突然安静，你从未如此清晰地感受到与她相连的枷锁的存在。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>……我听到了……是你……原来是你……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111025"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"一个声音自你意识深处响起，阴暗、扭曲、腐朽，又带着令人作呕的熟悉感——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>就是你在妨碍我！！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111027"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111028"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"尖刺破门而出，几根穿透了036的身体，海拉想要阻挡却被钉在地上，赫卡蒂将你推到一旁。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"content":"自那门后污染的聚合体也冲了出来，这次你清楚地听到它们身后的声音，跟遗产相似，却更加疯狂肆虐：","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>……她……<size=44>是我的！！</color></i></size>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5111031"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1}]}